## 📄 File 4: `.gitignore`

```gitignore
# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Editor files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# Node (if added later)
node_modules/

# Vercel
.vercel

# Environment
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# Cache
.cache/
dist/
build/